msgid "%d icons available"
msgstr "Na voljo ikon: %d"

msgid "%s selected"
msgstr "Izbrano: %s"

msgid "Accepted format: SVG with an &lt;svg&gt; root and a viewBox. Maximum size: %s. Icons are available in the picker and shortcodes as custom:&lt;name&gt;."
msgstr "Sprejemljiv zapis: SVG z koreninskim elementom &lt;svg&gt; in atributom viewBox. Največja velikost: %s. Ikone so na voljo v izbirniku in v shortcodeih kot custom:&lt;name&gt;."

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Dejanja"

msgid "Add icon"
msgstr "Dodaj ikono"

msgid "Allow Null"
msgstr "Dovoli prazno vrednost"

msgid "Allow the field to have no icon selected."
msgstr "Dovoli, da v polju ni izbrana nobena ikona."

msgid "Block saving with a validation error"
msgstr "Blokiraj shranjevanje z napako preverjanja"

msgid "Clear selection"
msgstr "Počisti izbiro"

msgid "Comma-separated terms that make the icon findable in the picker search."
msgstr "Z vejicami ločeni izrazi, po katerih je ikono mogoče najti v iskanju izbirnika."

msgid "Custom Icons"
msgstr "Ikone po meri"

msgid "Default Value"
msgstr "Privzeta vrednost"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Izbriši"

msgid "Delete this icon? Existing fields will fall back to their default behavior."
msgstr "Izbrišem to ikono? Obstoječa polja se vrnejo k privzetemu vedenju."

msgid "Docs"
msgstr "Dokumentacija"

msgid "Enter the icon value to be selected by default (e.g., \"rocket\" or \"simple:facebook\")."
msgstr "Vnesite vrednost ikone, ki bo privzeto izbrana (npr. \"rocket\" ali \"simple:facebook\")."

msgid "How to handle values that are not part of the bundled icon set (e.g. icons imported from another site or values left over after an icon library update)."
msgstr "Kako ravnati z vrednostmi, ki niso del vgrajenega nabora ikon (npr. uvožene ikone z druge strani ali preostale vrednosti po posodobitvi knjižnice ikon)."

msgid "Icon <strong>%s</strong> was added to the library."
msgstr "Ikona <strong>%s</strong> je bila dodana v knjižnico."

msgid "Icon <strong>%s</strong> was deleted."
msgstr "Ikona <strong>%s</strong> je bila izbrisana."

msgid "Icon Value (e.g., \"rocket\" or \"simple:facebook\")"
msgstr "Vrednost ikone (npr. \"rocket\" ali \"simple:facebook\")"

msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "Ključne besede"

msgid "Lucide Icon"
msgstr "Ikona Lucide"

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field — Custom Icons"
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field — ikone po meri"

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field:"
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field:"

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field: an icon with that name already exists. Uploads never overwrite stored icons; delete the old icon first or use another name."
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field: ikona s tem imenom že obstaja. Nalaganje nikoli ne prepiše shranjenih ikon; najprej izbrišite staro ikono ali uporabite drugo ime."

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field: some icon values are not part of the bundled icon set and will render as empty markup:"
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field: nekatere vrednosti ikon niso del vgrajenega nabora in bodo izrisane kot prazna oznaka:"

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field: that file is not a valid SVG document. Only plain shape elements (circle, ellipse, line, path, polygon, polyline, rect) inside an &lt;svg&gt; root are accepted."
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field: datoteka ni veljaven dokument SVG. Znotraj koreninskega elementa &lt;svg&gt; so sprejeti le preprosti grafični elementi (circle, ellipse, line, path, polygon, polyline, rect)."

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field: that file is too large. The limit is %s."
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field: datoteka je prevelika. Omejitev je %s."

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field: that icon no longer exists in the library."
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field: ta ikona v knjižnici več ne obstaja."

msgid "Mudrava Icon Field: the icon storage is not writable. Check filesystem permissions."
msgstr "Mudrava Icon Field: shramba ikon ni zapisljiva. Preverite dovoljenja datotečnega sistema."

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ime"

msgid "No custom icons yet."
msgstr "Ikon po meri še ni."

msgid "No icon selected"
msgstr "Izbrana ni nobena ikona"

msgid "No icons found"
msgstr "Ni najdenih ikon"

msgid "Optional; defaults to the file name"
msgstr "Neobvezno; privzeto se uporabi ime datoteke"

msgid "Placeholder"
msgstr "Vzorčno besedilo"

msgid "Placeholder text for the search input."
msgstr "Vzorčno besedilo za iskalno polje."

msgid "Please select a valid icon."
msgstr "Izberite veljavno ikono."

msgid "Please select an icon."
msgstr "Izberite ikono."

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Predogled"

msgid "Return Format"
msgstr "Vrnjena oblika"

msgid "SVG Markup"
msgstr "Oznaka SVG"

msgid "SVG file"
msgstr "Datoteka SVG"

msgid "Save and show an admin notice (default)"
msgstr "Shrani in prikaži obvestilo v skrbniškem vmesniku (privzeto)"

msgid "Search icons or brand logos..."
msgstr "Iskanje ikon ali logotipov blagovnih znamk..."

msgid "Search keywords"
msgstr "Ključne besede iskanja"

msgid "Select an icon"
msgstr "Izbira ikone"

msgid "Specify the format returned by get_field()."
msgstr "Določite obliko, ki jo vrača get_field()."

msgid "Stored icon is not in the bundled icon set"
msgstr "Shranjena ikona ni v vgrajenem naboru ikon"

msgid "Stored icons"
msgstr "Shranjene ikone"

msgid "The icon file could not be written."
msgstr "Datoteke ikone ni bilo mogoče zapisati."

msgid "The icon storage directory could not be created."
msgstr "Imenika za shrambo ikon ni bilo mogoče ustvariti."

msgid "The icon storage is not writable on this site."
msgstr "Shramba ikon na tem mestu ni zapisljiva."

msgid "The storage name is derived from this title: lowercase, dashes, max 64 characters."
msgstr "Ime v shrambi izpeljemo iz tega naslova: male črke, pomišljaji, največ 64 znakov."

msgid "This plugin requires %1$s version %2$s or higher to function."
msgstr "Vtičnik za delovanje zahteva %1$s različice %2$s ali novejši."

msgid "Title"
msgstr "Naslov"

msgid "Unknown Icon Values"
msgstr "Neznane vrednosti ikon"

msgid "Upload plain SVG icons to extend the picker with a custom set. Files are sanitized on upload: scripts, styles, embedded images and unsupported elements are removed, and only the allowlisted shape markup is stored."
msgstr "Naložite preproste ikone SVG in razširite izbirnik z lastnim naborom. Datoteke se ob nalaganju prečistijo: skripti, slogi, vgrajene slike in nepodprti elementi se odstranijo, shranjena ostane le dovoljena oznaka oblik."

msgid "Value"
msgstr "Vrednost"

msgid "You are not allowed to manage custom icons."
msgstr "Nimate dovoljenja za upravljanje ikon po meri."

msgid "logo, company, brand"
msgstr "logotip, podjetje, znamka"
